WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.810
A prepositional phrase is a little package.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:08.640
It starts with a word like in, on, under, or through, and it ends with a noun.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.120
In the baggage car.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.670
Through the woods.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.800
Find the first word, then find the noun that closes the package.
